#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Device"
msgstr "Mú Ẹ̀rọ Ṣiṣẹ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this device from being backed up."
msgstr "Yọ àmì kúrò nínú àpótí yìí láti dẹ́kun ṣíṣe àtìlẹ́yìn àfipamọ́ fún ẹ̀rọ yìí."

