#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì IP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the IP Address used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Èyí ni Àdírẹ́sì IP tí a lò láti bá ẹ̀rọ náà sọ̀rọ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "TFTP Server"
msgstr "Olùpèsè TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional TFTP server this device copies its configuration to. Leave blank to use the global TFTP Server setting."
msgstr "Olùpèsè TFTP àṣàyàn tí ẹ̀rọ yìí ń da ètò rẹ̀ sí. Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo láti lo ètò Olùpèsè TFTP gbogbogbòò."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stored SSH Host Key"
msgstr "Kọ́kọ́rọ́ Olùgbàlejò SSH tí a Fipamọ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Compare this host-key algorithm and SHA-1 hex fingerprint with the device through a trusted channel. On the server, replace the path below with the matching public host-key file and run: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Use the device action to clear it after a legitimate key change."
msgstr "Ṣe àfiwé àlùgọ́rídìmù kọ́kọ́rọ́ olùgbàlejò yìí àti ìtẹ̀ka hex SHA-1 pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rọ náà nípasẹ̀ ọ̀nà tí a fọkàn tán. Lórí sáfà, rọ́pò ipa-ọ̀nà ìsàlẹ̀ yìí pẹ̀lú fáìlì kọ́kọ́rọ́ olùgbàlejò gbangba tó báramu kí o sì ṣiṣẹ́: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Lo ìgbésẹ̀ ẹ̀rọ náà láti pa á rẹ́ lẹ́yìn àyípadà kọ́kọ́rọ́ tòótọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php router-backups.php router-devices.php
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Àkójọ-fáìlì"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the relative directory structure used to store the configs."
msgstr "Èyí ni ìṣètò àkójọ-fáìlì ìbátan tí a lò láti fi àwọn ìṣètò pamọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Schedule Type"
msgstr "Irú Ètò Àkókò"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How often to Backup this device. Daily with a Rerun Every of 10 performs a backup every 10 days; Monthly performs a true calendar-month backup."
msgstr "Ìgbà mélòó láti Ṣe Àfẹ̀yìntì ẹ̀rọ yìí. Ojoojúmọ́ pẹ̀lú Ìtúnṣe Ní Gbogbo 10 ń ṣe àfẹ̀yìntì ní gbogbo ọjọ́ mẹ́wàá; Oṣooṣù ń ṣe àfẹ̀yìntì oṣù kàlẹ́ńdà tòótọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Rerun Every"
msgstr "Tún ṣe ní Gbogbo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For Daily schedules, rerun the backup every X days. For Weekly schedules without specific Days of Week, rerun it every X weeks; once Days of Week are selected the backup runs on those days every week and this field does not apply."
msgstr "Fún àwọn ìṣètò àkókò Ojoojúmọ́, tún ṣe àfẹ̀yìntì ní gbogbo ọjọ́ X. Fún àwọn ìṣètò àkókò Ọ̀sọ̀ọ̀sẹ̀ láìsí àwọn Ọjọ́ Ọ̀sẹ̀ pàtó, tún ṣe é ní gbogbo ọ̀sẹ̀ X; ní gbà tí a bá ti yan àwọn Ọjọ́ Ọ̀sẹ̀, àfẹ̀yìntì yóò máa ṣiṣẹ́ ní àwọn ọjọ́ wọ̀nyẹn ní gbogbo ọ̀sẹ̀, ààyè yìí kò sì ní ṣiṣẹ́."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Àwọn Ọjọ́ Ọ̀sẹ̀"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Weekly schedule, the day(s) of the week to run the backup on, every week. Leave empty to run every Rerun Every weeks instead."
msgstr "Fún ìṣètò àkókò Ọ̀sọ̀ọ̀sẹ̀, àwọn ọjọ́ inú ọ̀sẹ̀ láti ṣe àfẹ̀yìntì ní gbogbo ọ̀sẹ̀. Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo láti ṣiṣẹ́ ní gbogbo ọ̀sẹ̀ Tún Ṣe Ní Gbogbo dípò."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Months of Year"
msgstr "Àwọn Oṣù Ọdún"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the month(s) of the year to run the backup in."
msgstr "Fún ìṣètò àkókò Oṣooṣù, àwọn oṣù inú ọdún láti ṣe àfẹ̀yìntì."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Àwọn Ọjọ́ Oṣù"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the day(s) of the month to run the backup on (Last = last day of the month)."
msgstr "Fún ìṣètò àkókò Oṣooṣù, àwọn ọjọ́ inú oṣù láti ṣe àfẹ̀yìntì (Ìkẹyìn = ọjọ́ ìkẹyìn oṣù)."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Weeks of Month"
msgstr "Àwọn Ọ̀sẹ̀ Oṣù"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the week(s) of the month to run the backup in."
msgstr "Fún ìṣètò àkókò Oṣooṣù ní Ọjọ́, àwọn ọ̀sẹ̀ inú oṣù láti ṣe àfẹ̀yìntì."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week (Monthly)"
msgstr "Àwọn Ọjọ́ Ọ̀sẹ̀ (Lóṣooṣù)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the weekday(s) to pair with the Weeks of Month selection."
msgstr "Fún ìṣètò àkókò Oṣooṣù ní Ọjọ́, àwọn ọjọ́ ọ̀sẹ̀ láti so pọ̀ mọ́ àṣàyàn àwọn Ọ̀sẹ̀ Oṣù."

