msgstr "Ṣé ìbéèrè ìjẹ́rìísí wà fún dídà ìṣètò náà?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Fipá Mú Ìjẹ́rìísí"

#: includes/arrays.php
