#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Ṣàyẹ̀wò Ìparí nínú Ìṣètò"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "Ṣàyẹ̀wò ìparí nínú ìṣètò?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Ìbéèrè Bọ́tìnì Eyíkéyìí"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Ọ̀rọ̀ láti bá àṣẹ́ irú 'Tẹ Bọ́tìnì Èyíkéyìí Láti Tẹ̀síwájú' mu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Àwọn Àṣẹ Lẹ́yìn Ìwọlé"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Àwọn àṣàyàn tọkọtaya ìbéèrè/ìdáhùn tí a fi ránṣẹ́ lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ lẹ́yìn ìwọlé, ṣáájú àṣẹ ìdàkọ-sí-TFTP, ọ̀kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan bíi prompt|response. A máa ń fi ìbéèrè náà wé èsì ẹ̀rọ gẹ́gẹ́ bí gbólóhùn déédéé tí kò ka lẹ́tà ńlá tàbí kékeré sí (nítorí náà fúnra rẹ̀ kò gbọdọ̀ ní | nínú, àti pé a gbọ́dọ̀ fi àmì àsálà sí àwọn àkámọ́ àti àwọn àmì pàtàkì mìíràn, àpẹẹrẹ Save \\[y/n\\]), a sì máa ń fi ìdáhùn ránṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí a ṣe tẹ̀ ẹ́, tàbí lo <CR> láti fi ìpadàsíbẹ̀rẹ̀ nìkan ránṣẹ́. A máa ń fi ìdáhùn ránṣẹ́ lẹ́yìn tí a bá ti rí ìbéèrè rẹ̀ nìkan, yálà nínú ìdáhùn sí ìdáhùn tẹ́lẹ̀ tàbí nínú èsì tí ó tẹ̀lé; bí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́ a ó kọ ìkìlọ̀ sílẹ̀, a kò sì ní fi ohunkóhun ránṣẹ́. A máa ń dáhùn àwọn wọ̀nyí lákọ̀ọ́kọ́; a ó dáhùn ìbéèrè Any Key lókè lẹ́yìn náà, nígbà tí a bá ń mú ẹ̀rọ náà ṣiṣẹ́, nítorí náà ìbéèrè tí a bá dáhùn níbí kì í dé Any Key láéláé. Àpẹẹrẹ: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Àwọn Ètò Gbogbogbòò"

#: includes/arrays.php
