msgstr "Ipò Ìfihàn"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Ṣé kí a ṣàfihàn Àwọn Ètò Olùdarí-ìsopọ̀ lórí Kọ́nsólù tàbí Táàbù Òkè."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Kọ́ńsólù"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Taàbù Òkè"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Àwọn Ìlà Àyíká Ìyàtọ̀ Ìṣètò"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Iye àìyípadà ti àwọn ìlà tí kò yípadà láti ṣàfihàn ṣáájú àti lẹ́yìn àyípadà kọ̀ọ̀kan nígbà tí a bá ń fi àwọn àtìlẹ́yìn méjì wéra. Iye tó tóbi jù máa ń jẹ́ kí ó rọrùn láti rí àyíká ìṣètò tó yí i ká. A lè yí èyí padà fún ìfiwéra kọ̀ọ̀kan lórí ojú-ewé Ìfiwéra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò ìsopọ̀ ti parí"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Àkókò ìdúró tó pọ̀ jù lọ ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá nígbà tí a bá ń ṣe ìsopọ̀ nẹ́tíwọ́ọ̀kì àkọ́kọ́ sí Ẹ̀rọ kan. A ó fi Ẹ̀rọ tí ó bá kọ́ tàbí tí kò ṣeé dé sílẹ̀ lẹ́yìn àkókò ìparí yìí kí ìṣiṣẹ́ àfẹ̀yìntì tí a ṣètò lè tẹ̀síwájú pẹ̀lú Àwọn Ẹ̀rọ tí ó kù."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Pa dé láìjáde"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Tí a bá yàn án, nígbà tí a bá ń pa ìsopọ̀ Ẹ̀rọ dé, a kò ní fi àṣẹ 'exit' ránṣẹ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Bọ́fà Àyẹ̀wò Àṣìṣe Àsopọ̀"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Bóyá láti kọ àbájáde tààrà ti àsopọ̀ ẹ̀rọ sílẹ̀"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "Gbà pé gbogbo àwọn ẹ̀rọ ní àṣẹ gíga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Bóyá láti gbà pé gbogbo àwọn ẹ̀rọ ní àṣẹ gíga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Wákàtí Ìgbàsílẹ̀"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Wákàtí ọjọ́ láti ṣe àwọn ìgbàsílẹ̀ kíkún."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Ètò Àtúngbìyànjú"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Àkókò láti dúró ṣáájú kí o tó gbìyànjú láti ṣe ìgbasílẹ̀ àfikún nígbà tí ìgbasílẹ̀ tí a ṣètò bá kùnà"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Àsìkò Ìpamọ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Iye ọjọ́ láti pa àwọn àkọpamọ́ àtijọ́ mọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Pa Àwọn Àfẹ̀yìntì Ẹ̀rọ Tí Kò Ṣiṣẹ́ Mọ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When checked, the retention cleanup will not delete aged-out backups that belong to disabled devices or to devices that have been removed, so configurations for decommissioned or unreachable equipment are retained."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá fọwọ́ sí i, ìwẹ̀nùmọ́ ìpamọ́ kò ní pa àwọn àfẹ̀hìntì tó ti pẹ́ rẹ́ tí wọ́n jẹ́ ti àwọn ẹ̀rọ àìṣiṣẹ́ tàbí àwọn ẹ̀rọ tí a ti yọ kúrò, kí a lè pa àwọn ìṣètò fún ohun èlò tí a ti dá dúró tàbí tí kò ṣeé dé ọ̀dọ̀ rẹ̀ mọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Transfer Options"
msgstr "Àwọn Àṣàyàn Ìgbéránṣẹ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default connection type"
msgstr "Irú àsopọ̀ àìyípadà"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Irú àsopọ̀ àìyípadà tí a lò láti bá ẹ̀rọ náà sọ̀rọ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate By Device"
msgstr "Yà Sọ́tọ̀ Nípa Ẹ̀rọ"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate archived Configs into a folder per device"
msgstr "Yà àwọn Ìṣètò tí a tọ́jú sọ́tọ̀ sínú fódà fún Ẹ̀rọ kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Abẹ́-fódà Tí Ó Ní Ọjọ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Fi àkójọpọ̀ abẹ́ tí ó dá lórí déètì sínú ipa ọ̀nà ìpamọ́ (ṣáájú àpò kọ̀ọ̀kan fún Ẹ̀rọ), kí a lè fi ìṣiṣẹ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan pamọ́ sábẹ́ déètì àfẹ̀yìntì rẹ̀, fún àpẹẹrẹ .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Pípà á tọ́jú ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ tó wà tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà SCP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ń lo SCP, fífi èyí sí òfo yóò lo módù SCP ti PHP èyí tí kì í ṣiṣẹ́ nígbà gbogbo. A ti sọ SCP ìta di àìṣiṣẹ́ nígbà tí ìjẹ́rìísí kọ́kọ́rọ́ olùgbàlejò SSH bá ṣiṣẹ́ nítorí kò lè tún àsopọ̀ tí a ti fìdí rẹ̀ múlẹ̀ lò."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verify SSH Host Keys"
msgstr "Jẹ́rìísí Àwọn Kọ́kọ́rọ́ Olùgbàlejò SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Record each device's SSH host key on first connect and refuse to send credentials if it later changes. SSH/Telnet mode will not fall back to Telnet while verification is enabled. After a legitimate key change, use the device action to clear the stored host key."
msgstr "Kọ kọ́kọ́rọ́ olùgbàlejò SSH ti ẹ̀rọ kọ̀ọ̀kan sílẹ̀ ní ìsopọ̀ àkọ́kọ́ kí o sì kọ̀ láti fi ìwé-ẹ̀rí ìwọlé ránṣẹ́ tí ó bá yípadà lẹ́yìn náà. Ipò SSH/Telnet kò ní padà sẹ́yìn sí Telnet nígbà tí ìjẹ́rìísí bá ń ṣiṣẹ́. Lẹ́yìn ìyípadà kọ́kọ́rọ́ tí ó tọ́, lo ìgbésẹ̀ ẹ̀rọ láti pa kọ́kọ́rọ́ olùgbàlejò tí a tọ́jú rẹ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "TFTP Server IP"
msgstr "IP Olùpèsè TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Must be an IP pointing to your Cacti server."
msgstr "Ó gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ IP tí ó ń tọ́ka sí sáfà Cacti rẹ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "TFTP Backup Directory Path"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Àkójọpọ̀ Àfẹ̀yìntì TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The path to where your Configs will be backed up, it must be the path that the local TFTP Server writes to."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí ibi tí a óò ti ṣe àfẹ̀yìntì àwọn ìṣètò rẹ, ó gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ ọ̀nà tí Olùpèsè TFTP agbègbè ń kọ sí."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Archive Directory Path"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà Àkójọpọ̀ Fáìlì Ìpamọ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The path to where your Configs will be archived (moved from TFTP directory)"
msgstr "Ọ̀nà sí ibi tí a óò fi àwọn ìṣètò rẹ pamọ́ sí (tí a gbé kúrò nínú àkójọpọ̀ fáìlì TFTP)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Email Options"
msgstr "Àwọn Àṣàyàn Ímeèlì"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "From Address"
msgstr "Àdírẹ́sì Olùfiránṣẹ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Email address the nightly backup will be sent from."
msgstr "Àdírẹ́sì ímeèlì tí a ó ti fi àfipamọ́ alẹ́ ránṣẹ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Orúkọ Olùfiránṣẹ́"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name the nightly backup will be sent from."
msgstr "Orúkọ tí àfẹ̀yìntì alẹ́ yóò ti ránṣẹ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Email Address"
msgstr "Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì Ímeèlì"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of Email addresses to send the nightly backup Email to."
msgstr "Àtòjọ àwọn àdírẹ́sì Ímeèlì tí àmì idánudúró pín sí láti fi Ímeèlì àtìlẹ́yìn òru ránṣẹ́ sí."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Config Diffs"
msgstr "Fi Àwọn Ìyàtọ̀ Ìṣètò Kún un"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Append a unified diff of each device whose configuration changed during the run to the backup Email, so a reviewer can see exactly what changed. Binary (non-text) configurations are skipped. Volatile lines that change on every backup (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' and 'Current configuration :', and NX-OS '!Time:' and '!Running configuration last done at:') are always ignored. Warning: the diff is sent in clear text to every recipient of the Email, so it can reveal configuration that should stay private; leave Include Secrets in Diffs unchecked."
msgstr "Fi ìyàtọ̀ àpapọ̀ ti ẹ̀rọ kọ̀ọ̀kan tí ìṣètò rẹ̀ yí padà nígbà ìṣiṣẹ́ kún Ímeèlì àfipamọ́, kí olùṣàyẹ̀wò lè rí ohun tó yí padà ní pàtó. A máa ń fò àwọn ìṣètò aláìṣọ̀rọ̀ (binary) dà. Àwọn ìlà tó máa ń yí padà ní gbogbo àfipamọ́ (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' àti 'Current configuration :', àti NX-OS '!Time:' àti '!Running configuration last done at:') ni a máa ń gbójú fò nígbà gbogbo. Ìkìlọ̀: a máa ń fi ìyàtọ̀ náà ránṣẹ́ ní ọ̀rọ̀ gbangba sí gbogbo olùgbà Ímeèlì náà, nítorí náà ó lè ṣí ìṣètò tí ó yẹ kí ó wà ní ìkọ̀kọ̀ payá; má ṣe sàmì sí Fi Àwọn Àṣírí Kún Nínú Àwọn Ìyàtọ̀."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Secrets in Diffs"
msgstr "Fi Àwọn Àṣírí Kún Àwọn Ìyàtọ̀"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Send secret values in the emailed diff as they are. When unchecked (the default), the changed lines are found on the raw configurations and printed redacted, failing closed: lines containing secret-like words (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) and SNMP host and user lines are reduced to their first word followed by &lt;secret hidden&gt;, and every line of a PEM block, a certificate or key-string block, or a multi-line quoted value, and any hex or base64 row, is hidden; a block that never ends hides the rest of the configuration. This also hides harmless lines (e.g. a description mentioning a key), but every changed line still shows up, marked (changed) when only its hidden part differs, and a block that never ends is noted in the Email. Stored backups are never changed."
msgstr "Fi àwọn ìní ìkọ̀kọ̀ ránṣẹ́ nínú ìyàtọ̀ tí a fi ímeèlì ránṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí wọ́n ti rí. Nígbà tí a kò bá ṣàmì sí i (àìyípadà), a ó wá àwọn ìlà tí ó yípadà lára àwọn ìṣètò àìṣàtúnṣe a ó sì tẹ̀ wọ́n jáde ní ìbòjú, pẹ̀lú dídí ní ìtìpa: àwọn ìlà tí ó ní àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ bíi ìkọ̀kọ̀ (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) àti àwọn ìlà olùgbàlejò àti olùlò SNMP ni a ó dín kù sí ọ̀rọ̀ àkọ́kọ́ wọn tí &lt;secret hidden&gt; tẹ̀lé, gbogbo ìlà ìdìpọ̀ PEM, ìwé-ẹ̀rí tàbí ìdìpọ̀ okùn kọ́kọ́rọ́, tàbí ìní àkọ́jọpọ̀ ìlà púpọ̀ tí a fi àmì ọ̀rọ̀ dì, àti ìlà hex tàbí base64 èyíkéyìí, ni a ó fi pamọ́; ìdìpọ̀ tí kò parí rárá yóò fi ìyókù ìṣètò náà pamọ́. Èyí tún máa ń fi àwọn ìlà aláìléwu pamọ́ (bí àpẹẹrẹ, àpèjúwe tí ó mẹ́nu ba kọ́kọ́rọ́ kan), ṣùgbọ́n gbogbo ìlà tí ó yípadà yóò ṣì hàn, tí a ó sàmì sí (changed) nígbà tí apá tí a fi pamọ́ nìkan bá yàtọ̀, a ó sì ṣàkọsílẹ̀ ìdìpọ̀ tí kò parí rárá nínú Ímeèlì. Àwọn àfipamọ́ tí a tọ́jú kì í yípadà láé."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Diff Exclude Patterns"
msgstr "Àwọn Àpẹẹrẹ Ìyọkúrò Ìyàtọ̀"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional regular expressions (one per line) matching configuration lines to ignore when comparing, so volatile lines such as timestamps or serial numbers do not show up as changes. Each pattern is matched case-insensitively anywhere in a line unless anchored with ^ or $; a pattern that is not a valid regular expression is ignored."
msgstr "Àwọn gbólóhùn déédéé àṣàyàn (ọ̀kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan) tí ó bá àwọn ìlà ètò mu láti fojú fò nígbà ìfiwéra, kí àwọn ìlà tí ó máa ń yípadà bíi àmì àkókò tàbí nọ́ńbà ìtẹ̀léra má baà hàn gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìyípadà. A máa ń fi àpẹẹrẹ kọ̀ọ̀kan wé ibikíbi nínú ìlà láìka lẹ́tà ńlá tàbí kékeré sí àyàfi tí a bá fi ^ tàbí $ dì í mú; a ó fojú fò àpẹẹrẹ tí kì í ṣe gbólóhùn déédéé tí ó tọ́."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Thold Notification List"
msgstr "Àtòjọ Ìfitónilétí Thold"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When Thold is installed, also send the backup Email to the recipients of the selected Thold Notification List."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá ti fi Thold sílẹ̀, tún fi Ímeèlì àtìlẹ́yìn ránṣẹ́ sí àwọn olùgbà ti Àtòjọ Ìfitónilétí Thold tí a yàn."

#: includes/devices.php
msgid "Add to RouterConfigs Backup"
msgstr "Fi kún Àfikọsílẹ̀ Ààbò RouterConfigs"

#: includes/devices.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to add the following Device(s) to RouterConfigs for backup. Any device already present in RouterConfigs is skipped."
msgstr "Tẹ 'Tẹ̀síwájú' láti fi Ẹ̀rọ wọ̀nyí kún RouterConfigs fún ìfipamọ́ àtẹ̀lé. Ẹ̀rọ èyíkéyìí tí ó ti wà nínú RouterConfigs tẹ́lẹ̀ ni a ó fo."

